<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<rspec xmlns="http://www.geni.net/resources/rspec/3"
       xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
       xmlns:emulab="http://www.protogeni.net/resources/rspec/ext/emulab/1"
       xsi:schemaLocation="http://www.geni.net/resources/rspec/3 http://www.geni.net/resources/rspec/3/request.xsd"
       type="request">
  <rspec_tour xmlns="http://www.protogeni.net/resources/rspec/ext/apt-tour/1">
    <description type="markdown">QBR inter-host RPC scheduling: five bare-metal c6525-25g nodes at CloudLab Utah, Ubuntu 22.04, one experiment LAN.</description>
    <instructions type="markdown">Roles and experiment IP addresses:
- client: 10.10.1.1 - open-loop RPC load generation and trace replay.
- dispatcher: 10.10.1.2 - ingress scheduling and optional central waiting queue.
- worker1: 10.10.1.11 - RPC execution and host-local shared queue.
- worker2: 10.10.1.12 - RPC execution and host-local shared queue.
- worker3: 10.10.1.13 - RPC execution and host-local shared queue.

Start with eight execution cores and one separate controller core on each worker.
Select physical CPU IDs after inspecting NUMA/SMT topology; the profile does not pin CPUs.
Three workers permit two-source/one-target reservation experiments.
Use only experiment IP addresses for requests, replies, load reports and migration.
Collect logs after timed runs; no dedicated logger node is requested.

Each experiment LAN attachment requests 25,000,000 Kbps (25 Gbps).
Check the allocated manifest, NIC link speed, MTU and routes before benchmarking.
Same-site placement does not guarantee one physical rack or an uncontended fabric.
The profile allocates resources only; it does not install or start QBR software.
</instructions>
  </rspec_tour>

  <node client_id="client" exclusive="true" component_manager_id="urn:publicid:IDN+utah.cloudlab.us+authority+cm">
    <sliver_type name="raw">
      <disk_image name="urn:publicid:IDN+emulab.net+image+emulab-ops//UBUNTU22-64-STD"/>
    </sliver_type>
    <hardware_type name="c6525-25g"/>
    <interface client_id="client:if0">
      <ip address="10.10.1.1" netmask="255.255.255.0" type="ipv4"/>
    </interface>
  </node>
  <node client_id="dispatcher" exclusive="true" component_manager_id="urn:publicid:IDN+utah.cloudlab.us+authority+cm">
    <sliver_type name="raw">
      <disk_image name="urn:publicid:IDN+emulab.net+image+emulab-ops//UBUNTU22-64-STD"/>
    </sliver_type>
    <hardware_type name="c6525-25g"/>
    <interface client_id="dispatcher:if0">
      <ip address="10.10.1.2" netmask="255.255.255.0" type="ipv4"/>
    </interface>
  </node>
  <node client_id="worker1" exclusive="true" component_manager_id="urn:publicid:IDN+utah.cloudlab.us+authority+cm">
    <sliver_type name="raw">
      <disk_image name="urn:publicid:IDN+emulab.net+image+emulab-ops//UBUNTU22-64-STD"/>
    </sliver_type>
    <hardware_type name="c6525-25g"/>
    <interface client_id="worker1:if0">
      <ip address="10.10.1.11" netmask="255.255.255.0" type="ipv4"/>
    </interface>
  </node>
  <node client_id="worker2" exclusive="true" component_manager_id="urn:publicid:IDN+utah.cloudlab.us+authority+cm">
    <sliver_type name="raw">
      <disk_image name="urn:publicid:IDN+emulab.net+image+emulab-ops//UBUNTU22-64-STD"/>
    </sliver_type>
    <hardware_type name="c6525-25g"/>
    <interface client_id="worker2:if0">
      <ip address="10.10.1.12" netmask="255.255.255.0" type="ipv4"/>
    </interface>
  </node>
  <node client_id="worker3" exclusive="true" component_manager_id="urn:publicid:IDN+utah.cloudlab.us+authority+cm">
    <sliver_type name="raw">
      <disk_image name="urn:publicid:IDN+emulab.net+image+emulab-ops//UBUNTU22-64-STD"/>
    </sliver_type>
    <hardware_type name="c6525-25g"/>
    <interface client_id="worker3:if0">
      <ip address="10.10.1.13" netmask="255.255.255.0" type="ipv4"/>
    </interface>
  </node>

  <link client_id="exp-lan">
    <interface_ref client_id="client:if0"/>
    <interface_ref client_id="dispatcher:if0"/>
    <interface_ref client_id="worker1:if0"/>
    <interface_ref client_id="worker2:if0"/>
    <interface_ref client_id="worker3:if0"/>
    <link_type name="lan"/>
    <component_manager name="urn:publicid:IDN+utah.cloudlab.us+authority+cm"/>
    <!-- LAN attachment capacity is in Kbps, matching geni-lib LAN serialization. -->
    <property source_id="client:if0" dest_id="exp-lan" capacity="25000000"/>
    <property source_id="dispatcher:if0" dest_id="exp-lan" capacity="25000000"/>
    <property source_id="worker1:if0" dest_id="exp-lan" capacity="25000000"/>
    <property source_id="worker2:if0" dest_id="exp-lan" capacity="25000000"/>
    <property source_id="worker3:if0" dest_id="exp-lan" capacity="25000000"/>
  </link>
</rspec>
